From: lean <chenlin@fnnas.com>
Subject: [PATCH] clk: qcom: videocc-sm8350: add 570 and 600 MHz rates

Add 570 and 600 MHz MVS0 source rates for SC8280XP. With the fixed hardware
dividers these provide 190-200 MHz Iris clocks and matching 285-300 MHz
controller clocks below the existing 240 MHz minimum OPP.

Signed-off-by: lean <chenlin@fnnas.com>
--- a/drivers/clk/qcom/videocc-sm8350.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/qcom/videocc-sm8350.c
@@ -164,6 +164,8 @@
 };
 
 static const struct freq_tbl ftbl_video_cc_mvs0_clk_src_8280xp[] = {
+	F(570000000, P_VIDEO_PLL0_OUT_MAIN, 1, 0, 0),
+	F(600000000, P_VIDEO_PLL0_OUT_MAIN, 1, 0, 0),
 	F(720000000, P_VIDEO_PLL0_OUT_MAIN, 1, 0, 0),
 	F(1014000000, P_VIDEO_PLL0_OUT_MAIN, 1, 0, 0),
 	F(1098000000, P_VIDEO_PLL0_OUT_MAIN, 1, 0, 0),
